{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2023-06-14 16:15:00', 'title': 'MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS FOUNDATION AND CALCULATED GENIUS ANNOUNCE RECIPIENTS OF 2023 BRIGHT MINDS, BOLD FUTURES SCHOLARSHIP', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY THE MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS FOUNDATION, THE CHARITABLE AND PHILANTHROPIC ARM OF MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS (NYSE: MSI), TOGETHER WITH CALCULATED GENIUS, AWARDED APPROXIMATELY $100,000 IN SCHOLARSHIPS TO 37 DESERVING STUDENTS FROM UNDERSERVED AND UNDERREPRESENTED CHICAGOLAND COMMUNITIES WHO ARE PURSUING DEGREES IN TECHNOLOGY AND ENGINEERING. THE 2023 BRIGHT MINDS, BOLD FUTURES SCHOLARSHIP IS RENEWABLE, ALLOWING STUDENTS TO RECEIVE $3,000 DURING THEIR FIRST YEAR OF COLLEGE AND.'}